notes.content:
Thank you for playing the Alpha Demo during Steam Next Fest! 

We've released a small update based on your feedback. Please, continue sending it here and on DIscord! 

[list]
[*] Can now rebind the keys F and R for toolbelt and class tools;
[*] Implemented a possible fix for being unable to move character at game start;
[*] Added better support for unicode characters for house name and character name (Korean Characters);
[*] Discord button added to login screen;
[*] Adjusted matchmaking to help prevent connecting to high latency servers.
[/list]
